.TH start-cli-volumes-set-grant 1  "set-grant "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-volumes\-set\-grant \- Grant or revoke a package\*(Aqs access to a shared volume
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli volumes set\-grant\fR [\fB\-\-readonly\fR] [\fB\-\-revoke\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> <\fIPACKAGE_ID\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Grant or revoke a package\*(Aqs access to a shared volume
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-readonly\fR
Grant read\-only access
.TP
\fB\-\-revoke\fR
Revoke the package\*(Aqs access
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Shared volume ID
.TP
<\fIPACKAGE_ID\fR>
Package identifier
